  (text "R1/C1 set fc = 1/(2*pi*R*C) = 1.6 kHz; 1% / 10% parts put the corner within +/-6%.\nC2 decouples U1 at 50 V on a 5 V rail (10x headroom, so the ceramic keeps its value).\nU1 is unity gain: rail-to-rail output is not needed, the buffered signal stays under 3 V." (at 88.9 88.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"))

